n the linux-firmware repo as e.g.:<div><br></div><div>egisvision/EV620_00_1=
.5.1.C106_ARC2.7.bin</div><div><br></div><div>which would then be installed=
 on a filesystem as</div><div><br></div><div>/usr/lib/firmware/egisvision/E=
V620_00_1.5.1.C106_ARC2.7.bin</div><div><br></div><div>and when the device =
driver is loaded it would specify that location to load the file.=C2=A0 I w=
